        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In December 2020, we entered into a joint venture with Overland Pharmaceuticals (“Overland”) to develop and commercialize ZYNLONTA and certain now-discontinued product candidates (collectively, the “Licensed Products”) in greater China and Singapore.",
        "start_character": 55601,
