        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, with respect to each licensed target, we agreed to use commercially reasonable efforts to develop and commercialize at least one product and submit an IND application with the FDA (or its equivalent in another jurisdiction) for one product within 48 months after formal designation of the target as an approved target, which we have done with respect to CD19 and CD25 upon submitting the IND applications for ZYNLONTA and Cami, respectively.",
