        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the relapsed or refractory DLBCL setting, for which we have developed ZYNLONTA, current 3L treatment options include CAR-T, allogeneic stem cell transplant, polatuzumab in combination with bendamustine and a rituximab product, selinexor, tafasitamab in combination with lenalidomide, brentuximab in combination with bendamustine and a rituximab product, chemotherapy using small molecules and bispecifics antibodies.",
